Begin3
Title:		evidence
Version:	@VERSION@
Entered-date:	@ISODATE@
Description:	Evidence is a GTK2/evas2 file manager.
		It works as a file manager out of a box, but as backends
		(GNOME-VFS, efsd, POSIX, libfiletutils, ...), file-actions
		(info, send per email, archive, ...) and meta-data providers
		(MP3, OGG, ...) may easily be added, it is really a framework;
		all fanciness is optional and will be loaded on demand,
		avoiding "bloat". gnomecanvas or evas2 may be used for a canvas,
		the latter enabling theming of the shelf and icon-view.
Keywords:	evidence enlightenment e17 evas2 gevas2 file-manager file-browser
Author: 	evidence@azundris.com (Azundris)
Maintained-by:	evidence@azundris.com (Azundris)
Primary-site:	metlab.unc.edu pub/Linux/apps/some/directory
		31k evidence-@VERSION@.tar.gz
		500  evidence.lsm
Alternate-site: 
Original-site:  evidence.sourceforge.net
Platforms:      linux, solaris(?)
Copying-policy:	GNU copyleft
